      "notes": [
        "Razorgore's room, from the trigger landing: one pack, Grethok the Controller (12557) with his two Blackwing Guardsmen (14456). Their enter-combat sets instance data 0 (TYPE_RAZORGORE) IN_PROGRESS and Razorgore in combat with the zone (instance_blackwing_lair.cpp OnCreatureEnterCombat), and the orb trigger 14453 spawns the add waves from then on: the fight starts with any pull here, so the pack is a deliberate pull and the boss is the event's hold.",
        "The 30 Black Dragon Eggs (177807) and the Orb of Domination (177808) stand around the room. The eggs are destroyed only by the player the orb possesses (go_oeuf_razAI OnUse with the possessed Razorgore as user), and the orb's GOHello needs Razorgore already in combat (GOHello_go_orbe_domination): no bot can do that, so the plan has no orb or egg step and the hold waits for instance data 0 DONE, which needs a player at the orb. Blocker, see the prep."
      ]
    },
